<section class="heading">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT IDEA STARTS HERE</p><h1>A little less setup.<br>A lot more possibility.</h1><p class="lede"><%= App::TITLE %> is ready for its first feature.</p></div>
  <span class="welcome-seal" aria-hidden="true">c.</span>
</section>
<section class="welcome-grid" aria-label="Start building">
  <article class="welcome-card"><span class="step">01</span><h2>Make a feature</h2><p>Create a model, pages, and forms together.</p><pre><code>frappe make resource Book title:string author:string</code></pre></article>
  <article class="welcome-card"><span class="step">02</span><h2>Apply your migration</h2><p>Keep database changes explicit and versioned.</p><pre><code>frappe migrate</code></pre></article>
  <article class="welcome-card"><span class="step">03</span><h2>Make it yours</h2><p>Your files are ordinary Crystal, HTML and CSS.</p><pre><code>frappe test</code></pre></article>
</section>
